      "side": 1,
      "message": "I moved the original drm_hal_vendor_module_api.h under include/. `include/` is now exported as part of libdrmvtshelper (introduced in aosp/1216756). This is a symlink from the original location to the new location such that files including drm_hal_vendor_module_api.h can still find the header (and not break the build). Users of drm_hal_vendor_module_api.h should link to libdrmvtshelper in the future instead. I will update dependents of drm_hal_vendor_module_api.h to use libdrmvtshelper in future changes.",
